{"parse": {"title": "LEE-09", "pageid": 88299, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LEE-08\" title=\"LEE-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LEE-09</span><a href=\"/wiki/LEE-10\" title=\"LEE-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LEE</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">09</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.88.98.E4.BA.89.E4.B8.8E.E5.92.8C.E5.B9.B3\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"战争与和平\">战争与和平</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 战争与和平</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Science Salon</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>关<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>何<span class=\"color-value\"></span>理<span class=\"color-value\"></span>解<span class=\"color-value\"></span>每<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>位<span class=\"color-value\"></span>拉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>普<span class=\"color-value\"></span>拉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>斯<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2410109</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“人工暴雨”项目非正式会议，于“自由海风号”启航前</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\"><img alt=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅰ：</div><div>你疯了吗，乌尔里希？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅰ：</div><div>“暴雨”已经害死了那么多人，你居然还打算搞出一场“人工暴雨”？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>别那么紧张，乔纳森！我会严格控制实验区域与参与人员，你的名字不在上面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>更何况，目前的技术处于瓶颈阶段，我们尚有不少实验难题需要解决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>至少现在，我可以向你保证，这座大楼绝对安全！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅰ：</div><div>什么——你已经在开展实验了？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅱ：</div><div>乌尔里希，我必须警告你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅱ：</div><div>自从解开“星锑望远镜”的谜题之后，你就把拉普拉斯的规章制度远远甩在了脑后！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅱ：</div><div>调用其他分部资料，征用珍贵素材，私自实验——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>停止你的污蔑，佩内洛普！我关于“人工暴雨”的每一次行动，都按照现行的规定向总部的中心负责人提交了审批。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅰ：</div><div>该死的，你明知道那个鸟位置现在还空着！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>你瞧，我这不是还专程请来了代理负责人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它朝着一个阴沉的方位点头致意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我再重申一次，我不是代理负责人！除了露西女士，现在没人能坐那个位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟悉的敲桌声又一次重重响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>收起这些不着边际的话术吧，各位同僚。我们要在这儿讨论的是关于“星锑望远镜”的处理方案，而不是针对乌尔里希个人的投诉大会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-517001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-517001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-517001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅲ：</div><div>嘿嘿，这并不难，朋友们～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-517001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-517001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-517001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅲ：</div><div>我们完全可以学普列谢茨克那群家伙，就在第三次暴雨的时候来着——找上几个勇敢的同事，“砰”地送到近地轨道上去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-614001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-614001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-614001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅳ：</div><div>没错，既然我们能造一次天文望远镜，为什么就不能造第二次呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一侧突兀地响起了掌声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>哇哦，多么天才的想法啊～这也是为了对照组试验对不对？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>我猜你打算送的不止一颗卫星，而是搭载不同材料的几十颗卫星！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-614001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-614001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-614001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅳ：</div><div>……这有什么问题吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>我倒是有个更省事的提议——或许我们可以再等一段时间，让“暴雨”把我们带回1995年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>“啪——”！我们的卫星就能直接出现在天上，甚至还能为我们节省一大笔经费。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>兔毛手袋研究员，请遵循学术交流的基本礼节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>如果他们不打算把拉普拉斯的经费消耗个干净的话，我倒是很愿意这么做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>我赞成兔毛手袋研究员的异议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>重新发射卫星毫无必要，我们应该把注意力放到“人工暴雨”项目上来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>组长一拍桌子，将所有人的注意力拢回了一处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>“人工暴雨”项目已经取得了相当的成果！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众人：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>我收集了“星锑望远镜”搭载清单上的全部材料，甚至包括普列谢茨克航天基地的太空种子——你们应该知道它们有多难搞到，甚至超过了星锑的唱片！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>不要试图粉饰自己的偷窃行为，乌尔里希！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅴ：</div><div>我早就听说了你的实验进展，它根本没有你吹嘘的那么顺利！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅴ：</div><div>通过声波发生器按照固定频率促进非对称核素R发生反应，以模拟“暴雨”环境。你的实验方向看似美好——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅴ：</div><div>可结果呢？<br />乌尔里希，你找到那种能够免疫回溯的材料了么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>你是对的，卢卡斯。目前的“人工暴雨”实验流程存在严重缺陷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅴ：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>经过26次在实验室环境下的“人工暴雨”反应，我确认了包括7种太空种子、天体摄谱仪、高速光度计、黑曜石晶体、泽兰护符的材料效果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>它们确实不具备免疫回溯的功能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅴ：</div><div>那你是打算放弃了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>当然不!</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>组长尴尬地轻咳两声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……只是非对称核素R的储备严重不足了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>什么——？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>愤怒的研究员像是触电般蹦到了桌上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>冷静点，兔毛手袋！——乔纳森研究员，去调用最新材质的解压弹力球！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>拍桌子可不只是你的特权，代理负责人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乌尔里希面前的桌子几乎快要震飞出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>见鬼，你把那些非对称核素R都用了？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>这是必要的实验耗材。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>当然，毕竟你有源源不断的耗材可以填进去，再愚蠢的学生把答题卡填满内容也总会有蒙中的时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>再跑快几步，你就能在错误的道路上蹿得更远了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>你负责的是生物技术组，我不需要向你汇报我的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乌尔里希按住桌子，以减轻脑袋里磁流体与桌子的共振。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>那可不是一星半点！你几乎把拉普拉斯和基金会所有分部的非对称核素R库存掏了个干净——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>就连我那聒噪的同事九个人都用不了这么多非对称核素R，而我填上几十张那该死的申请表才能被批准用上堪堪几滴——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>兔毛手袋的工牌在某种强劲而琐碎的咬合声中吱呀作响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>要我说，如果你们一开始就把浪费的经费和非对称核素R让给我的项目，我很乐意在下一次“暴雨”时带着那些需要验证的材料去外头跑上几圈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>我们不会漠视任何一个实验人员的生命安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-517001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-517001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-517001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅲ：</div><div>最安全的项目当然是重新发射一颗新的卫星。更何况，科算中心还能找到不少致力于太空研究的前辈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我否决这一提案，目前最了解太空的研究员还躺在拉普拉斯的病房里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众人：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼下的硝烟短暂地消散了，终于有人想起会议的正题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅱ：</div><div>你打算如何推进下一步实验，乌尔里希？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>当然是到外面去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>非对称核素R储备最丰富的地方绝不是我们的实验室或是基金会的储物间，而是整个世界！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>更重要的是，过往的“人工暴雨”研究忽略了纯粹环境的影响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅴ：</div><div>你只是在为你的失败找借口，乌尔里希！其他地方的研究所怎么可能比我们的实验室更加纯净呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>“暴雨”的象征从来都不是纯粹，而是混沌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-521901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅴ：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>可你要怎么满世界地找到你声称的混沌环境，这是在大海捞针！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>会议室的天才们各不相让，为自己的项目与研究预算而战。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>够了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>再这样争执下去，连那个鬼鬼祟祟的洛伦兹研究所的进度都要超过我们了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它重重地将一封蝴蝶纹样的信封拍在桌上，为这团热闹的火又添了一把薪柴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>洛伦兹……那个古怪的神秘学至上的秘密结社？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>让我瞧瞧，它们又寄了什么挑衅信过来？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅱ：</div><div>住嘴，兔毛手袋——我们有专业的碎纸机！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>急促的脚步踏入了这片纷乱的废墟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>女士们，先生们，很抱歉打扰你们的头脑风暴，圣洛夫基金会方通过了最新的决议。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LEE-09"}}